  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ff48cf57-9a78-5f16-82c5-5d744212600d" activityNameId="b9394948-590b-5c96-ab46-69c755548aa7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Toner, colour, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Toner, colour, powder, at plant
The dataset represents the production of a  black toner powder with the composition 5% Color, 83% Binder Resin, colour, the rest being organic and anorganic additives. It is designed for the use in colour toner cartridges of the colours Cyan, Magenta and Yellow. An update in 2023 was done to regionalize energy and material input in the inventory; UUID: ced975cb-4c3d-3304-90f2-05e2c921a993
Includes the raw materials, their transportation and the energy use in the production. Infrastructure is included in the dataset of resin production. No process emissions considered.
Location: Global Electricity mix and material processing data for supplier outside Europe.
Technology: Production by conventional pulverisation of styrene butadiene copolymer that is produced by emulsion polymerisation.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The chosen conventional technology might prove outdated and chemically produced toner less energy intensive. Due to proprietary nature and considerable bandwith of different formulations, high uncertainty assumed. Generic data for pigments underestimate actual impacts.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ced975cb-4c3d-3304-90f2-05e2c921a993.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
